If a clinician prescribes an opioid-pain-medication with a benzodiazepine then the clinician should heed a particular-caution.
If a patient has a patient-circumstance and the patient-circumstance warrants a concurrent-opioid-benzodiazepine-prescribing then every clinician may prescribe an opioid-pain-medication with a benzodiazepine for the patient.
